  "description": "Grupo Valcarce es un conjunto empresarial enfocado al servicio en el sector transportes. Estaciones de Servicio, Gasolineras y Tarjeta Transporte",
  "longDescription": "Grupo Valcarce is a leading brand in the transportation sector, offering a wide range of products and services. With a strong focus on customer satisfaction, Grupo Valcarce has established itself as a trusted and reliable partner for both professionals and individuals. What started as a family business has evolved into a unique proposition in the market, with over twenty years of experience and a solid position in the industry. Grupo Valcarce is currently undergoing an expansion process, reaching out to a growing number of customers with its diverse and expanding range of services. Their services include fuel stations, transportation cards, telepeaje devices, insurance coverage, recovery of VAT, and even hotels. With a commitment to quality and a passion for the road, Grupo Valcarce is the go-to brand for all your transportation needs. Join their network of stations or explore their services today.",
